---
description: Shared component placement and dFDA design conventions
globs: 
alwaysApply: true
---


- Make sure to place components in the root /components folder and not the /app folder
- Use server components whenever possible and always for pages
- Pages should be server components and import client components

- Before UI changes, read and follow [the shared design system](../../../../docs/DESIGN-SYSTEM.md), including its UI change workflow and definition of done. Reuse this app's existing theme/components and verify desktop, mobile and keyboard interactions. Keep detailed design rules in that document rather than duplicating them here.
